_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.3\n- Not reproducible in: Any other version, as far as I know\n\n### System information\n\nGodot Engine v4.3.stable.official Vulkan 1.4.312 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti\n\n### Issue description\n\n@Timbo-Griffiths encountered an issue in Godot 4.3's export section, when he tried to export some resources required by his project to the export folder. He couldn't find any documentation that states this does export folders and files separately with the EXE.\n\n<img width=\"774\" height=\"476\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/766a4d6c-ecfe-433b-8edf-39ea91fff44b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the MVP from Google Drive. \nOpen the project.\nOpen the export menu.\nGo to resources.\nAdd folder/** to export non-resource files/folders and try export the project. \nGo to exported project location and look for the \"folder\" next to the EXE.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1HpmL774oPhF1PX3U5-_0uL1BAaXQ1muj/view?usp=sharing","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110118/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}